  "details": "Unable to load public worlds or join friends minus one world i tend to frequent oddly enough which i did include in my join attempts and was able to get in with a random person there but population count doesn't seem to be a factor as I've sometimes gotten into worlds with 20 or so people, but 90% of the time i just cant get into any sadly. also around the 8 minute mark of my video i noticed a random block of red pixels on the loading screen, a little difficult to see in my recording but it is there only when the load screen is up.\n\nVRChat build: 772\n\nPC specs are:\ni5-6600\n16gb ddr4\nevga 1080ti\n\nrecording of issue saved to YouTube as an unlisted video below:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P9uluzW-0ko",
